Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:01.73,TL,,0,0,0,,擦网为啥喊 {\fs78}let{\fs68}？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.67,TL,,0,0,0,,主裁喊的是阻碍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:07.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Let, first serve.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦网 一发重发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:12.52,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Let, first serve.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦网 一发重发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.32,0:00:19.92,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Let, first serve.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦网 一发重发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.22,0:00:21.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's the hat trick.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是第三个了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:24.66,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Let.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N擦网重发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:28.16,TL,,0,0,0,,连着{\fs78}4{\fs68}个擦网 主裁喊了{\fs78}4{\fs68}次 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:29.57,TL,,0,0,0,,球明明碰的是网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.57,0:00:31.25,TL,,0,0,0,,为什么不喊 {\fs78}net{\fs68}？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.96,0:00:33.56,TL,,0,0,0,,答案
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.56,0:00:36.64,TL,,0,0,0,,藏在一个快被忘掉的古英语词里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.36,0:00:38.88,TL,,0,0,0,,英语里有两个 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.88,0:00:41.18,TL,,0,0,0,,常用的那个是让 允许
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.18,0:00:43.77,TL,,0,0,0,,网球里这个 来自另一个古英语词
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.77,0:00:46.83,TL,,0,0,0,,意思几乎相反 阻碍 耽搁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.36,0:00:50.93,TL,,0,0,0,,这个意思 日常口语里早就不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.93,0:00:53.63,TL,,0,0,0,,却留在了法律文书和球场上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.76,0:00:56.52,TL,,0,0,0,,英国护照首页印着 {\fs78}without{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.52,0:00:58.80,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}let{\fs68} {\fs78}or{\fs68} {\fs78}hindrance{\fs68} 通行无阻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.80,0:00:59.56,TL,,0,0,0,,这里的 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.56,0:01:01.92,TL,,0,0,0,,和 {\fs78}hindrance{\fs68} 一样 是阻碍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:04.74,TL,,0,0,0,,所以主裁喊 {\fs78}let{\fs68} 宣布的是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.74,0:01:07.11,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分被阻碍了 不算
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:10.09,TL,,0,0,0,,国际网联的规则写得更宽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.09,0:01:11.74,TL,,0,0,0,,只要这一分被意外打断
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.74,0:01:14.05,TL,,0,0,0,,就判 {\fs78}let{\fs68} 再打一遍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.56,0:01:16.79,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2022{\fs68}年鹿特丹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.79,0:01:18.86,TL,,0,0,0,,奥热-阿利亚西姆打完这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.86,0:01:21.50,TL,,0,0,0,,以为拿下了赛点 赢下比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.16,0:01:24.39,TL,,0,0,0,,可就在这一分里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.39,0:01:26.77,TL,,0,0,0,,穆雷的帽子掉在了地上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.27,0:01:31.13,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm not trying to cheat.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我不是想耍赖
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.43,0:01:34.09,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I hit the ball and my hat fell off immediately,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我一击球 帽子就掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.09,0:01:35.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and I stopped, okay?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我就停了 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.85,0:01:38.55,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I promise that's what happened. I'm sorry.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我保证就是这样 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.91,0:01:41.01,TL,,0,0,0,,两人同意 再打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.21,0:01:44.06,TL,,0,0,0,,巡回赛规则里 帽子掉落 口袋掉球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.06,0:01:45.99,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次判 {\fs78}let{\fs68} 再犯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.99,0:01:48.71,TL,,0,0,0,,就算妨碍对手 直接丢分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.21,0:01:51.60,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:53.09,TL,,0,0,0,,一根羽毛飘进场地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:55.30,TL,,0,0,0,,兹维列夫捡起来给主裁看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:01:57.28,TL,,0,0,0,,球滚进场 纸片被吹进来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.28,0:01:59.10,TL,,0,0,0,,都算意外干扰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.21,0:02:01.27,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月初中网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.27,0:02:03.95,TL,,0,0,0,,兹维列夫说发球时广告屏变了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.95,0:02:06.10,TL,,0,0,0,,回看后 判 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.07,0:02:11.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I mean, this must be one of the most stupid change of rules that I've ever heard in my life.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这是我听过最蠢的规则改动之一
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:15.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}There is no sense if a player sees{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这说不通 球员要是看到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.93,0:02:19.81,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}that there is a hindrance of that shot, he stops immediately.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N那一拍受了干扰 会马上停下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:25.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I mean, we can play a 30-shot rally and he can lose the point,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我们打了三十拍 他丢了这一分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.39,0:02:26.77,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}he's like, OK, I'm going to challenge now.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N然后说 好 我现在要挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.01,0:02:29.51,TL,,0,0,0,,他气的是对手打完几拍 丢了分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.51,0:02:31.39,TL,,0,0,0,,才申请回看 另外
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.39,0:02:33.45,TL,,0,0,0,,观众喊叫不算干扰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.11,0:02:36.19,TL,,0,0,0,,最常见的 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.19,0:02:38.38,TL,,0,0,0,,还是发球擦网 只重发这一发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:41.10,TL,,0,0,0,,一发还是一发 二发还是二发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.51,0:02:44.14,TL,,0,0,0,,今年温网{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.14,0:02:45.63,TL,,0,0,0,,大坂直美对穆霍娃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.63,0:02:47.11,TL,,0,0,0,,又一个擦网 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.11,0:02:48.97,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}BBC{\fs68} 解说纳芙拉蒂洛娃说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.97,0:02:50.94,TL,,0,0,0,,取消吧 没用
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.31,0:02:54.40,TL,,0,0,0,,她的理由是 大多数擦网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.40,0:02:56.40,TL,,0,0,0,,只是轻轻蹭了一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.91,0:02:59.58,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}ATP{\fs68} 早就试过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.58,0:03:00.69,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2017{\fs68}年起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.69,0:03:02.87,TL,,0,0,0,,新生代总决赛不再有发球 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.87,0:03:04.41,TL,,0,0,0,,擦了网也接着打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.41,0:03:06.16,TL,,0,0,0,,国际网联的规则附录里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:07.98,TL,,0,0,0,,也留着这种打法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.41,0:03:13.08,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2025{\fs68}年澳网表演赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:14.44,TL,,0,0,0,,郑钦文搭档德约
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.44,0:03:17.21,TL,,0,0,0,,打快四赛制 发球擦网不重发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.21,0:03:18.51,TL,,0,0,0,,她这边以为要重发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.51,0:03:21.00,TL,,0,0,0,,这一分丢了 还被破了发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:23.64,TL,,0,0,0,,就是这一发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.63,0:03:26.23,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh man, these rules.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N天哪 这规则
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.67,0:03:28.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I had no idea that was going to happen.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我完全没想到会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.09,0:03:29.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I forgot.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.35,0:03:32.02,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}let{\fs68} 不只网球在用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.02,0:03:33.37,TL,,0,0,0,,乒乓球发球擦网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.37,0:03:34.94,TL,,0,0,0,,同样判 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.30,0:03:40.10,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}You also get yes lets, which is when you get the clearing player,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N还有 {\fs78}yes{\fs68} {\fs78}let{\fs68} 让位的一方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:43.76,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}the non-striker, and the striker who's going in to hit the ball,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也就是非击球方 和上前击球的一方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.76,0:03:46.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and they just clash, and no one's really at fault.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N撞在了一起 谁都没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:48.77,TL,,0,0,0,,壁球里两人撞上 谁都没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.77,0:03:50.08,TL,,0,0,0,,也判 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:52.52,TL,,0,0,0,,羽毛球也有 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:54.95,TL,,0,0,0,,可它的发球擦网过去 照打
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.95,0:03:56.97,TL,,0,0,0,,所以 {\fs78}let{\fs68} 不是让 是挡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.97,0:03:58.67,TL,,0,0,0,,下次听到主裁喊 {\fs78}let{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.67,0:04:01.56,TL,,0,0,0,,你就知道 刚才那一下 被挡住了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.56,0:04:02.81,TL,,0,0,0,,要是由你来定规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.81,0:04:05.42,TL,,0,0,0,,发球擦网 还要不要重来？
